msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/admin-api.rst:10
#: d403313956fd4caaac466e7e41835214
msgid ""
"The goals of the Admin API system is to provide a way for the user to manage "
"the domains without direct access to dom0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/admin-api.rst:13
#: b6df67a9e5de4d35bff203862f27bdfa
msgid "Foreseen benefits include:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/admin-api.rst:15
#: 3f0d764d898a4ed38f1efcbbaececeb8
msgid "Ability to remotely manage the Qubes OS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/admin-api.rst:16
#: 1bd67a4d38f04191b8f8da15fdae97f7
msgid ""
"Possibility to create multi-user system, where different users are able to "
"use different sets of domains, possibly overlapping. This would also require "
"to have separate GUI domain."
msgstr ""

